# The CLI does NOT fall back to .gitignore, so anything large has to be listed again here
# or `vercel --prod` uploads it. `backup-oldwebsite/wpuploads.zip` alone is 535 MB, which
# trips Vercel's 100 MB per-file limit and fails the deploy on upload.
backup-oldwebsite/

# ⚠️ Do NOT ignore `research/` wholesale — `lib/static-pages.ts` reads
# `research/data/static-pages.json` at build time via path.join(process.cwd(), …), so
# excluding it breaks the prerender of /about-us and every other static page. gitignore
# semantics cannot re-include a path under an ignored parent, so the heavy subdirectories
# are listed one by one instead and research/data/ stays.
research/crawl/
research/screenshots/
research/screenshots-full/
research/recrawl-2026-06/
research/db-2026-07/
research/crawl-meta.json
research/crawl-progress.json
research/*.png
